97
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:06,600
But I say, love your enemies, pray for those who persecute you, and that way you will be acting as true children of your Father in heaven.

98
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,940
For he gives sunlight to both the evil and the good.

99
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:12,420
He sends rain on the just and the unjust alike.

100
00:08:13,220 --> 00:08:17,380
And we live in a culture that is highly emotionally driven.

101
00:08:17,380 --> 00:08:23,080
